# A study directory tracks only its inputs — Snakefile, config*.yaml, discover.py.
# Everything below is produced by running it: cases/ is the staging root, results/
# the per-case JSON, report* the rendered report (report/, report.html, report.md).
# work/ was the old combined pipeline's staging root.
verification/foam_tutorials/*/work
verification/foam_tutorials/*/cases
verification/foam_tutorials/*/results
verification/foam_tutorials/*/report*
